diff --git a/gcc/ChangeLog b/gcc/ChangeLog
index 511ee66141e3..22a8c06d2d5e 100644
--- a/gcc/ChangeLog
+++ b/gcc/ChangeLog
@@ -1,3 +1,26 @@
+2026-09-04  Vineet Gupta  <vineet.gupta@linux.dev>
+
+	Backported from master:
+	2026-06-24  Vineet Gupta  <vineet.gupta@linux.dev>
+
+	PR debug/125421
+	* dwarf2out.cc (modified_type_die): Handle qualified_type being
+	a variant of dtype as if they were identical to avoid peeling a
+	typdef.
+	For named types, use dentry unconditionally as that is valid for
+	both cases of qualified_type == and  != dentry.
+
+2026-09-04  Georg-Johann Lay  <avr@gjlay.de>
+
+	Backported from master:
+	2026-09-04  Georg-Johann Lay  <avr@gjlay.de>
+
+	PR target/127188
+	* config/avr/avr-passes.cc (avr_pass_2moves) <optimize_2moves_bb>:
+	Use next_nondebug_insn_bb to traverse the insns.
+	<optimize_2moves>: Ignore degug insns when traversing
+	DF_REG_USE_CHAIN.
+
